From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jake Leventhal <jakeleventhal@me.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:05:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] fix(orchestration): resume continuations after planned
 worktree handoffs

Port of pingdotgg/t3code#15203 (head 3430a29a65cf) until it is merged upstream. Fixes #15136.

The PR's last commit also ends the run's open root items, such as the
t3_worktree_handoff call itself, as interrupted when the planned detach
closes ingestion.
